# ERROR EXAMPLE: Typos on the simple input line
# Two deliberate misspellings: "B3LPY" (should be B3LYP) and "Feq" (should be Freq)
# ORCA's parser cannot recognise unknown method or keyword strings
# ORCA error: "Unknown keyword" or "Unknown functional" in input parsing
# Fix: Correct to B3LYP and Freq; always double-check simple input line spelling
! B3LPY 6-31G(d) Opt Feq pal16

%maxcore 6000

* xyz 0 1
O      0.000000    0.000000    0.117300
H      0.000000    0.756950   -0.469200
H      0.000000   -0.756950   -0.469200
*
